{
 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 71.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，检查每一个低级 call 的返回值，并确认目标有代码。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，检查每一个低级 call 的返回值，并确认目标有代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 9.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "接代币的人，按实收记账。部署到 TRON，单独处理 USDT 推送。",
   "spoken": "接代币的人，按实收记账。部署到 TRON，单独楚理 USDT 推送。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.896,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 10.994,
   "speechEnd": 16.908
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "审计的人，找出每个推送资金的循环，问：有人拒收会怎样？",
   "spoken": "审计的人，找出每个推送资金的循环，问：有人拒收会怎样？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.98,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 18.078,
   "speechEnd": 23.066
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "普通用户，只授权需要的数额，用完就撤销。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，只授权需要的数额，用完就撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.408,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 24.506,
   "speechEnd": 28.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "收到陌生代币，不要去卖，也不要去领。",
   "spoken": "收到陌生代币，不要去卖，也不要去领。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.188,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 29.286,
   "speechEnd": 32.286
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "在 TRON 上转 USDT，确认状态是成功，不只是已广播。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上转 USDT，确认状态是成功，不只是已广播。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.344,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 33.442,
   "speechEnd": 38.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "回到开头。没有收到钱，桥为什么记下了一笔存款？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。没有收到钱，桥为什么记下了一笔存款？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.42,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 39.518,
   "speechEnd": 44.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "因为它把成功加空返回，当成了到账，又没有问对方存不存在。",
   "spoken": "因为它把成功加空返回，荡成了到账，又没有问对方存不存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.44,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 45.538,
   "speechEnd": 50.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-09",
   "text": "外部调用的返回，只是对方的说法。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用的返回，只是对方的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-09.mp3",
   "start": 51.9,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 51.998,
   "speechEnd": 54.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-10",
   "text": "要证明钱到了，就看余额的变化。前提是，你清楚这个代币会不会收税。",
   "spoken": "要证明钱到了，就看余额的变化。前提是，你清楚这个代币会不会收税。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-10.mp3",
   "start": 55.696,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 55.794,
   "speechEnd": 61.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-11",
   "text": "对方未必按标准出牌，你的合约要自己核对。",
   "spoken": "对方未必按标准出牌，你的合约要自己核对。",
